<StudioLayout title="Tools for makers. Worlds for players. \u2014 Strategic Sloth" description="Strategic Sloth is an independent tools and game development studio. Explore SliceForge, Focusrail, DriveDeck, NarriaFlow, and thoughtful game UI design.">

<section class="hero container"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="live-dot"></span> INDEPENDENT TOOLS & GAME STUDIO</p><h1>Less friction.<br>More <span class="hero-accent">possibility.<svg viewBox="0 0 600 28" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 18 Q270 -3 591 13"/></svg></span></h1><p class="lede">We build tools that get out of your way.<br>For creative work, everyday workflows, and play.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="/products/" data-track="cta_click" data-track-location="hero">Explore our tools <span>↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="/studio/">Meet the studio <span>→</span></a></div><p class="hero-footnote">Thoughtful by nature. Built to make a difference.</p></div><div class="hero-canvas action-canvas" aria-label="Animated studio composition with our sloth mascot and interface components"><div class="canvas-grid"></div><div class="canvas-label">THE STRATEGIC SLOTH WORKSHOP <span>01 / ∞</span></div><div class="orbit orbit-one"></div><div class="orbit orbit-two"></div><div class="shape-cross">✳</div><div class="mascot-disc"><img src="/studio-images/wow-druid.png" alt="Our glasses-free sloth mascot swinging through a low-poly forest" width="1024" height="1024" fetchpriority="high"></div><div class="floating-panel panel-tools"><span class="micro">MAKE SOMETHING</span><div class="color-swatches"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class="panel-line"></div><div class="panel-line short"></div><span class="panel-tag">A little less busywork.</span></div><div class="floating-panel panel-play"><span class="play-symbol">▶</span><div>Made for play.<small>Designed with intention.</small></div></div><span class="cursor-label"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 2 21 13 13 15 9 23Z"/></svg>Strategic Sloth</span><div class="canvas-bottom"><span>TOOLS. WORLDS. POSSIBILITIES.</span><button class="motion-toggle" type="button" aria-pressed="false" hidden>Pause motion Ⅱ</button></div></div></section>
<div class="discipline-strip"><div class="container"><span>Small studio. Full-picture thinking.</span><p>Creative & desktop tools <b>✳</b> Game UI & UX <b>✳</b> Interactive experiences</p></div></div>
<section class="section container" id="tools"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">01 / BUILT FOR THE WORK</p><h2>Good tools.<br>More room to create.</h2></div><p>Practical solutions to the small things<br>that slow big ideas down.</p></div><div class="product-grid"><article class="product-card" data-status="live"><a class="product-image sage" href="https://www.sliceforge.io/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="/studio-images/sf-compose.webp" alt="SliceForge editor with an editable fantasy game interface" loading="lazy" width="1536" height="1024"><span class="image-label">REFERENCE → READY TO BUILD</span></a><div class="product-info"><div class="product-title"><h3>SliceForge</h3><span class="status">Available · Free to start</span></div><p>Turn visual references into editable game interfaces. Build screens, refine component states, and export your UI kit.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://www.sliceforge.io/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Explore SliceForge <span>↗</span></a></div></article><article class="product-card" data-status="live"><a class="product-image lilac" href="https://www.fab.com/listings/47a56c00-ab32-4c20-8aba-04935b4a2578" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><div class="focus-demo" aria-hidden="true"><div class="demo-top"><span>FOCUSRAIL / UMG</span><span>FOCUS MEMORY</span></div><div class="demo-menu"><span>Resume game</span><span class="selected">Inventory <b>← Focus restored</b></span><span>Settings</span></div><div class="demo-bottom">01 — Remember. Restore. Keep playing.</div></div><span class="image-label">FOCUSRAIL / BEHAVIOR ILLUSTRATION</span></a><div class="product-info"><div class="product-title"><h3>Focusrail</h3><span class="status">Available on Fab</span></div><p>Predictable controller navigation for Unreal Engine. Restore focus, track navigation paths, and keep the right widget in view.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://www.fab.com/listings/47a56c00-ab32-4c20-8aba-04935b4a2578" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Discover Focusrail <span>↗</span></a></div></article><article class="product-card drivedeck-card" data-status="launch" id="drivedeck"><a class="product-image drive-blue" href="/drivedeck/" aria-label="Explore DriveDeck"><div class="drive-illustration" aria-hidden="true"><div class="drive-window"><div class="drive-window-bar"><strong>DriveDeck</strong><span>YOUR WORKSPACE, ON YOUR DRIVE</span></div><div class="drive-folders"><div><i></i>Projects</div><div><i></i>Archives</div><div><i></i>Music</div><div><i></i>DJ Sets</div></div><div class="drive-window-bottom"><span>Organize. Transfer. Take it with you.</span><b>↗</b></div></div><span class="image-label">WORKSPACE ILLUSTRATION · WINDOWS FIRST</span></div></a><div class="product-info"><div class="product-title"><h3>DriveDeck</h3><span class="status launch">Built · Awaiting launch</span></div><p>Your drive, organized like a workspace. Turn an external SSD into a desktop for files, projects, and music—with reliable transfers and native safe eject.</p><a class="text-link" href="/drivedeck/">Meet DriveDeck <span>↗</span></a></div></article><article class="product-card narria-card" data-status="launch" id="narriaflow"><a class="product-image narria-lavender" href="/narriaflow/" aria-label="Explore NarriaFlow"><div class="narria-canvas" aria-hidden="true"><div class="narria-canvas-top"><strong>NarriaFlow</strong><span>A WORLD TAKING SHAPE</span></div><svg class="story-connections" viewBox="0 0 500 300" preserveAspectRatio="none"><path d="M110 100 C230 100 160 170 260 170 S350 70 415 70 M260 170 C310 170 330 250 420 240"/></svg><div class="story-note story-person"><span>CHARACTER</span><strong>The cartographer</strong><p>She remembers places<br>that no longer exist.</p><i>Connected to Chapter 01</i></div><div class="story-note story-chapter"><span>CHAPTER 01</span><strong>The city<br>between tides</strong><p>At dawn, the streets<br>began to disappear.</p><div class="story-lines"></div></div><div class="story-note story-world"><span>WORLD NOTE</span><strong>A changing coast</strong><div class="story-lines"></div></div><span class="narria-art-label">CANVAS ILLUSTRATION · SAMPLE STORY</span></div></a><div class="product-info"><div class="product-title"><h3>NarriaFlow</h3><span class="status launch">Complete · Awaiting launch</span></div><p>Write Your World. An infinite-canvas writing app for authors who think visually. Bring chapters, characters, and connected ideas into one creative workspace.</p><a class="text-link" href="/narriaflow/">Meet NarriaFlow <span>↗</span></a></div></article></div><a class="development-row" href="/world-editor/"><span class="status neutral">In development</span><strong>SliceForge World Editor</strong><span>Paint a grid. Preview a world. Playtest what you build.</span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></a></section>
<GameUIPacks />
<section class="container home-workbench" aria-label="Free tools"><a class="free-workbench-link" href="/free-tools/"><div class="workbench-symbol" aria-hidden="true">↗</div><div><span class="eyebrow">THE FREE WORKBENCH</span><h3>A small tool for the task at hand.</h3><p>16 browser-based utilities for sprites, UI, colors, exports, and audio. No account required.</p></div><span class="workbench-link-label">Browse free tools <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span></a></section><section class="studio-section"><div class="container studio-grid"><div class="studio-work-preview"><div class="work-preview-top"><span>FROM THE STUDIO</span><span>SLICEFORGE / COMPOSE</span></div><img src="/studio-images/sf-workspace.webp" alt="A science-fiction game interface arranged in the SliceForge workspace" loading="lazy" width="1536" height="1024"><div class="work-preview-caption"><strong>Behind every screen, a system.</strong><p>Layouts, component states, and the details that make an interface work.</p><a class="text-link" href="/studio/#selected-work">Explore the work <span>↗</span></a></div></div><div class="studio-copy"><p class="eyebrow">02 / THE STUDIO MINDSET</p><h2>Serious about craft.<br>Always up for play.</h2><p>Strategic Sloth is an independent studio founded by Remi Couture. We bring game UI, development tools, and interactive ideas together under one roof.</p><p>From HUDs and menus to engine handoffs, nearly 20 years of game UI experience shapes how we build. SliceForge and Focusrail support game production. DriveDeck organizes your working files. NarriaFlow gives authors space to shape a story. Different workflows, the same care for the person using them.</p><a class="text-link" href="/studio/">Get to know the studio <span>↗</span></a><div class="studio-values"><span>Independent by choice</span><span>Built from experience</span></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section container"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">03 / WORLDS IN THE MAKING</p><h2>A world to enter.<br>A legacy to leave.</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/games/">Games & experiments <span>↗</span></a></div><div class="experiment-row"><span class="experiment-number">↳</span><div><span class="status neutral">In development · Coming soon</span><h3 aria-label="Unrevealed game"><span class="hidden-game-title" aria-hidden="true">██████ █████████</span></h3><p>A medieval browser RPG. An unwritten story. More will be revealed when the time is right.</p></div><a class="round-link" href="/unrevealed-game/" aria-label="Discover Unrevealed game">↗</a></div></section><section class="container learn-home"><p class="eyebrow">THE LEARNING LIBRARY</p><h2>Make room for what’s next.</h2><p>Free articles, practical creator tools, and books for independent work. Explore one topic at a time, at your own pace.</p><a class="text-link" href="/learn/">Explore Learn <span>→</span></a></section><section class="contact-band"><div class="container"><div><p class="eyebrow">BUILD SOMETHING GOOD</p><h2>Your next idea.<br>Our kind of challenge.</h2></div><a class="button light" href="/contact/">Work with the studio <span>↗</span></a></div></section>
</StudioLayout>
